  "details": "Pretty short and simple, if you VRCInstantiate a prefab that has dynamic bones on it, the dynamic bones have no effect in game, while working fine in Unity.\nHere is a test world with an avatar prefab you can pick up with dynamic bones, and pressing the button spawns the same prefab, but with non-functioning dynamic bones.\nhttps://vrchat.com/i/cow-lillyroar-583f7\nHopefully this issue does not extend to other whitelisted scripts.",
